  OpenBook Graphics (ANAL-323) starts out not stopped. AOSP 17 scans every new system app that has a launcher entry
  in the stopped state (config_stopSystemPackagesByDefault, InstallPackageHelper), and a stopped app receives no
  broadcast until someone opens it: no BOOT_COMPLETED, so no notification after an Ultimate that rolled back and no
  boot sync of the games rule. Seen in the first QEMU run of the G14 product with the app (anal323a).
-->
<config>
    <initial-package-state package="org.openbook.graphics" stopped="false"/>
</config>
